### Quick Capture Database Operations

**Query unprocessed items:**
```
mcp__notion__notion-fetch with database ID
Look for items where Processed = false (unchecked)
```

**Mark item as processed:**
```
mcp__notion__notion-update-page
  page_id: [item ID]
  command: "update_properties"
  properties: {"Processed": "__YES__"}
```

