## Session Start Protocol

When user triggers the skill, execute this sequence:

### Step 1: Check Quick Capture Database (FIRST)
```
Fetch quick_capture database using mcp__notion__notion-fetch
Filter for items where Processed = false (unchecked)
If unprocessed items exist:
  → Show: "📥 You captured {count} things since last session"
  → List items with their Type
  → Process these BEFORE normal workflow
```

### Step 2: Read Claude Scratch
```
Fetch claude_scratch page
Read "Current Focus" and "Open Threads" sections
This is YOUR context from last session
```

### Step 3: Fetch Design Doc State
```
Fetch design_doc page
Parse PROJECT SNAPSHOT for status, phase, next action
```

### Step 4: Present Orientation
```
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
